  "title": "Russian Pelmeni",
  "description": "Pelmeni are boiled Russian dumplings made with a simple dough of flour, egg, oil, water, and salt filled with a mixture of ground beef and onion.",
  "authors": [
    "Volnushka"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-04T00:09:35-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-06-20T13:42:33-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT60M",
  "cook_time": "PT20M",
  "total_time": "PT140M",
  "yield": [
    "12",
    "100 pelmeni"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dinner",
    "Appetizer"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "Russian"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "Russian"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 large egg",
    "1 teaspoon vegetable oil",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.75 cup warm water, or more as needed",
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon all-purpose flour for dusting",
    "18 ounces ground beef",
    "1 small onion, chopped",
    "1.5 tablespoons ice-cold water",
    "1 tablespoon coarse salt",
    "freshly ground pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VZY_DYqVF3zwOlvZNMpYHZBpWxI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-366bbc59b5c648828569b617f3d088d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make dough: Combine egg, oil, and salt in a liquid measuring cup; add enough warm water to fill to 1 cup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xkoH66bWl4pCPqLyilBRUn5Llxw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-0546d98e547a499dbfc4b8a834299666.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into a large bowl and knead in 3 cups flour until smooth and elastic.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1fJX3WToR9NmJpkzElht1ajk6L4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-e827b000c3104c119fa0e2df4edddb27.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover with a dish towel and let dough rest for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DLUQyYRW4bdjNykg3eacifp6_p0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-5bf4f72e66d04bba8af60bc7f977b15a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make filling: Combine ground beef, onion, water, salt, and pepper in a medium bowl; mix thoroughly by hand or using a fork. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wv-JgLofK64FZOlnPv7XeM5kNRE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-5088b69deeab4410988f6ccb048df5f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dust a baking sheet lightly with 1 tablespoon flour; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZtkEzz3td8UF0amArtwU0KPtOjY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-0daa32d55bde47e98033fba509912641.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out a portion of dough very thinly on a lightly floured surface; keep remaining dough covered with a dish towel to avoid drying out.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8e1S0VuHz6RC167HnnlC7fsMT9g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-07-0c140736697247f3b325a6ab7fa81da6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut out 2 1/2-inch rounds with a cookie cutter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5cZ9JqSgkPWSWrSvSzDaWVOtzg4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-08-f2645c7d7526495b8274731f3c4d24fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place about 1 teaspoon filling on one side of each dough circle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Cg7fU5-MSqqRnayEwoiHWTNa4Vw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-09-be889d1c521d4b00ac35194a051bcbfa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold dough over and seal the edges using your fingers, forming a crescent.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/L79gXbg-OqyHDNIuk6vAAh8VLqc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-015-5c5d59a9141c4fa3b40c9d408cb81656.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Join the ends and pinch them together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/64l5ksfSjolJ923EnL-jkfRYNPY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-10-4f167c8e872c4a9a9dd85388ce10801a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place on the prepared baking sheet. Repeat with remaining dough and filling. Freeze pelmeni for 30 minutes to prevent them from sticking together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5s11xkhHOx6wP0Dsykz_HHBAuw4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-11-94ce49032b174d2dbe854470174e8da4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_12.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a simmer. Working in batches, cook frozen pelmeni in simmering water until meat is cooked through and pelmeni float to the top, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i98TZ1V3yz_hxIX_9oRmxnK_to0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-12-fc17727d42714e239952e4dff6eacdf4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_13.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue cooking for 5 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pFdKINw9gydu8biNL0Cf_B_0X3k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-13-1c496a881bf34353a4d7e43531f40cf4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_14.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to serving plates using a slotted spoon. Serve and enjoy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4DBuI0yr3YOk-vRgNjAWboM8rO4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259977-russian-pelmeni-ddmfs-4x3-step-14-22cac06256694f85bc00fe425b50938d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259977/step_15.webp"
    }
  ],
